    "detailed_description": "<strong>Bring your dream start-up to life! </strong><br><br>Decorate your shop to attract more customers and manage day-to-day duties:<br><br>. Upgrade your equipment to improve quality.<br>. Hire and promote employees to boost efficiency.<br>. Make contracts with local shops to diversify your menu according to your customers' needs, improve customer loyalty, and earn more.<br>. Keep your inventory stocked full to meet the growing demand<br>. As you maximize efficiency, you can buy your alliance's business to produce your own goods, in the quality you like.<br>. Expand your brand from the suburbs to the metropolis.<br><br>Your decisions can make or break your business's growth, so plan wisely!",
